  "translations": {
    "translations": [
      {
        "iso_3166_1": "VN",
        "iso_639_1": "vi",
        "name": "Tiếng Việt",
        "english_name": "Vietnamese",
        "data": {
          "homepage": "",
          "overview": "Bị đôi giày kém chất lượng làm đau chân, Nami quay lại cửa hàng. Nhà thiết kế Lebno đề nghị làm lại đôi giày cho cô – nếu cô chịu làm người mẫu cho buổi diễn thời trang của ông.",
          "runtime": 0,
          "tagline": "",
          "title": "One Piece: Nữ hùng"
        }
      },
      {
        "iso_3166_1": "CN",
        "iso_639_1": "zh",
        "name": "普通话",
        "english_name": "Mandarin",
        "data": {
          "homepage": "",
          "overview": "《海贼王》短篇小说集《海贼王女英雄们的故事》宣布动画化，原作剧情包括时装秀登台的娜美、协助克尔拉和萨博解读黏土板的罗宾、因一封情书而盛传谣言的薇薇、与米霍克争夺红酒的佩罗娜等，将通过本篇中未曾描绘的故事展现她们的个性与魅力。",
          "runtime": 23,
          "tagline": "",
          "title": "海贼王：女英雄们的故事"
        }
      },
      {
        "iso_3166_1": "US",
        "iso_639_1": "en",
        "name": "English",
        "english_name": "English",
        "data": {
          "homepage": "https://www.crunchyroll.com/watch/GE00380778JAJP/one-piece-heroines",
          "overview": "After failing to stop the thieves due to ill-fitting shoes, Nami storms into the shop where she bought them for a refund. However, the head designer offers to make her a new pair from scratch on one condition: she must walk in their upcoming fashion show.",
          "runtime": 24,
          "tagline": "",
          "title": "One Piece Heroines"
        }
      },
      {
        "iso_3166_1": "FR",
        "iso_639_1": "fr",
        "name": "Français",
        "english_name": "French",
        "data": {
          "homepage": "https://www.disneyplus.com/fr-fr/browse/entity-3edd36d4-5010-45cf-8da1-701124c3c858",
          "overview": "Des chaussures défectueuses empêchent Nami d'arrêter un vol. Furieuse, elle se rend à la boutique de son achat pour se les faire rembourser. Cependant, le directeur artistique de la griffe offre de lui fabriquer une paire flambant neuve à une condition : qu'elle accepte de les porter à son prochain défilé de mode.",
          "runtime": 23,
          "tagline": "",
          "title": "One Piece : Heroines"
        }
      },
      {
        "iso_3166_1": "JP",
        "iso_639_1": "ja",
        "name": "日本語",
        "english_name": "Japanese",
        "data": {
          "homepage": "",
          "overview": "作りの粗い靴で足を痛めてしまったナミは、その靴を返品しようと店に戻る。デザイナーのルブノは、「ショーに出てくれれば、靴を作り直す」とナミに持ちかけるのだが...。",
          "runtime": 0,
          "tagline": "",
          "title": ""
        }
      },
      {
        "iso_3166_1": "BR",
        "iso_639_1": "pt",
        "name": "Português",
        "english_name": "Portuguese",
        "data": {
          "homepage": "",
          "overview": "Nami compra um par de sapatos, mas volta à loja com os pés machucados. O estilista Lebno se oferece para refazê-los, com uma condição: Nami terá que desfilar para ele.",
          "runtime": 0,
          "tagline": "",
          "title": ""
        }
      },
      {
        "iso_3166_1": "PL",
        "iso_639_1": "pl",
        "name": "Polski",
        "english_name": "Polish",
        "data": {
          "homepage": "",
          "overview": "Nami, której stopy otarły tandetne buty, wraca do sklepu. Projektant Lebno proponuje, że zrobi je od nowa, jeżeli Nami wystąpi w jego pokazie jako modelka.",
          "runtime": 0,
          "tagline": "",
          "title": "One Piece: Heroines"
        }
      },
      {
        "iso_3166_1": "DE",
        "iso_639_1": "de",
        "name": "Deutsch",
        "english_name": "German",
        "data": {
          "homepage": "",
          "overview": "Nami kauft ein Paar Schuhe, doch sie bereiten ihr schreckliche Fußschmerzen. Als sie die Schuhe zurückgeben will, trifft sie auf Lebno Listchaque, einen renommierten Designer, der sich bereit erklärt, ein neues Modell anzufertigen. Doch unter einer Bedingung: Sie soll an seiner nächsten Modenschau teilnehmen. Als die Seefahrerin die Schuhmacherin Miucha kennenlernt, hilft Nami ihr dabei, ihr verlorenes Selbstvertrauen in ihr Handwerk wiederzuerlangen.",
          "runtime": 0,
          "tagline": "",
          "title": "ONE PIECE HEROINES"
        }
      },
      {
        "iso_3166_1": "TH",
        "iso_639_1": "th",
        "name": "ภาษาไทย",
        "english_name": "Thai",
        "data": {
          "homepage": "",
          "overview": "หลังจากซื้อรองเท้าคู่หนึ่งแล้วทำให้เท้าเธอเจ็บ นามิก็กลับไปที่ร้านด้วยความไม่พอใจ ที่นั่นเธอได้พบกับเลบโน ดีไซเนอร์ผู้บอกกับเธอว่า \"ฉันจะทำรองเท้าคู่ใหม่ให้เธอตั้งแต่ต้นเลย—แต่ต้องให้เธอเป็นนางแบบให้ฉันนะ\" รองเท้าคู่นั้นถูกสร้างสรรค์โดยช่างฝีมืออย่างมิอุชา นำไปสู่การพบกันที่คาดไม่ถึงและมีสไตล์",
          "runtime": 0,
          "tagline": "",
          "title": "ONE PIECE HEROINES"
        }
      },
      {
        "iso_3166_1": "MX",
        "iso_639_1": "es",
        "name": "Español",
        "english_name": "Spanish",
        "data": {
          "homepage": "",
          "overview": "Luego de que un par de zapatos de mala calidad le lastiman los pies, Nami regresa a la tienda. El diseñador Lebno se ofrece a rehacerlos... si ella acepta modelar en su pasarela.",
          "runtime": 23,
          "tagline": "",
          "title": "One Piece: Heroines"
        }
      },
      {
        "iso_3166_1": "KR",
        "iso_639_1": "ko",
        "name": "한국어/조선말",
        "english_name": "Korean",
        "data": {
          "homepage": "",
          "overview": "한 켤레의 신발이 맺어준 인연. 나미와 구두 장인 미우차의 만남.",
          "runtime": 0,
          "tagline": "",
          "title": "원피스 히로인즈"
        }
      },
      {
        "iso_3166_1": "IT",
        "iso_639_1": "it",
        "name": "Italiano",
        "english_name": "Italian",
        "data": {
          "homepage": "",
          "overview": "Nami ha acquistato un nuovo paio di scarpe dal negozio Lebno Listchaque, ma dato che le fanno male ai piedi torna a restituirle. Quando la giovane calzolaia Miucha le dice che purtroppo il negozio non accetta restituzioni, arriva il proprietario Lebno che offre a Nami di metterle a posto le scarpe in cambio della sua partecipazione nella sfilata di moda per presentare i nuovi modelli.",
          "runtime": 0,
          "tagline": "",
          "title": ""
        }
      },
      {
        "iso_3166_1": "TW",
        "iso_639_1": "zh",
        "name": "普通话",
        "english_name": "Mandarin",
        "data": {
          "homepage": "",
          "overview": "娜美因為穿了劣質鞋而腳痛，於是回到店裡退貨。設計師魯布諾給她了一個條件：「如果你參加時裝秀，我就給你重新做一雙鞋，」但是…",
          "runtime": 0,
          "tagline": "",
          "title": "ONE PIECE HEROINES"
        }
      },
      {
        "iso_3166_1": "HK",
        "iso_639_1": "zh",
        "name": "普通话",
        "english_name": "Mandarin",
        "data": {
          "homepage": "",
          "overview": "故事以《海賊王》中登場的女性角色作為主角，描寫她們各自「做自己」的一面。除了奈美之外，魯賓等角色也會登場，並加入動畫原創的劇情內容，帶來不同於本傳的新視角。",
          "runtime": 0,
          "tagline": "",
          "title": "ONE PIECE HEROINES"
        }
      },
      {
        "iso_3166_1": "ES",
        "iso_639_1": "es",
        "name": "Español",
        "english_name": "Spanish",
        "data": {
          "homepage": "",
          "overview": "Nami vuelve a la tienda cuando unos zapatos de mala calidad le hacen daño en los pies. El diseñador Lebno se ofrece a arreglarlos, a cambio de que ella desfile en su pasarela.",
          "runtime": 0,
          "tagline": "",
          "title": "One Piece: Heroínas"
        }
      },
      {
        "iso_3166_1": "TR",
        "iso_639_1": "tr",
        "name": "Türkçe",
        "english_name": "Turkish",
